# Headstone Pilgrimage: not current (The Temple of Uggalepih current). Norg's Gilgamesh plays that mission's
# 8 (04_The_Temple_of_Uggalepih's reply); the La Theine headstone says CANNOT_REMOVE_FRAG (7608, La Theine's
# DefaultActions).
lists LaTheinePlateau/Cermet_Headstone/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/200 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/201
lists Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrigger
char zone=Norg pos=120,-8,-12 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheTempleOfUggalepih current
login
trigger Gilgamesh                       # The Temple of Uggalepih's 8
finish
warp -170,38,-505 LaTheinePlateau
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # CANNOT_REMOVE_FRAG (DefaultActions)
